post_install() {
	cat <<'MSG'
  Polycarbon downloads its Wine runtime (~95 MB) the first time you run a
  Windows program, into ~/.local/share/polycarbon. Nothing goes outside your
  home directory and nothing needs root.

  That first run also makes polycarbon the handler for the Windows file types
  no other program has claimed. To do it now, or to take over types something
  else already owns:

      polycarbon --register [--force]
MSG
}
